{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1220502001:0":{"text":"小家伙，你们有没有在村子附近看到几只白净的小猪？","source_cn":"小家伙，你们有没有在村子附近看到几只白净的小猪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FAF3850BABAC864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220502002:1":{"text":"小猪？\n唔……好像没有。","source_cn":"小猪？\\n唔……好像没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6069A9DCFF20EC29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220502003:0":{"text":"会不会是被水鬼帮掠走了？毕竟之前那么混乱，他们很可能趁机抢走了不少东西。","source_cn":"会不会是被水鬼帮掠走了？毕竟之前那么混乱，他们很可能趁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8521596FC79A257","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220502004:1":{"text":"我也是这么怀疑的。水鬼帮那群混蛋，绝对干得出来这种事！","source_cn":"我也是这么怀疑的。水鬼帮那群混蛋，绝对干得出来这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA14296983DE15A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220502005:1":{"text":"以前他们就经常跑来侵扰我们村子！这一次要不是他们人多势众，我一直在保护其他人，根本顾不上这些家畜，又怎么可能被他们得逞！","source_cn":"以前他们就经常跑来侵扰我们村子！这一次要不是他们人多势...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA087B1D3DFB13DFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu